      "text": "These reports, which must be signed by each commissioner or agency head, will be turned over to a Vehicular Control Board which I plan to create shortly. It will be the responsibility of this board to review the city motor system and to determine exactly and immediately what cars and which drivers will be reassigned to a centralized Public Works Department Pool.",
